## Support

Support is provided through GitHub issues:

- under the Free License, on a best-effort basis;
- under a Company License, standard support with a first response within 3 working days;
- under an Enterprise agreement, priority support with a first response within 12 hours on working days, unless the agreement says otherwise.

Working days are business days in the Czech Republic. The response times are targets, not a service-level agreement; an Enterprise agreement may add one.
